summary: The metarecord-detail panel type

!! Commands

* ``metarecord:back`` — Metarecord: back to the previously shown metarecord
* ``metarecord:bulk`` — Bulk operation on the selection or the current query
* ``metarecord:cancel`` — Cancel the current field edit or add form
* ``metarecord:create`` — Create a new metarecord
* ``metarecord:delete`` — Delete the selected metarecord
* ``metarecord:field`` — Field operation on this metarecord
* ``metarecord:open-add-field`` — Open the add-field form on the selected metarecord
* ``metarecord:reconcile`` — Reconcile the selected metarecord's subtree (`watch`: start tracking it first)
* ``metarecord:row-delete`` — Delete the field under the cursor
* ``metarecord:row-edit`` — Edit the field under the cursor
* ``metarecord:row-next`` — Move the field cursor down
* ``metarecord:row-prev`` — Move the field cursor up
